    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan3_LunTaiSuiXiaoXian_L001",
      "original_quote": "論太歲小限星辰廟陷遇十二宮中吉凶依此判斷人行年災患應如神",
      "tag": [],
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "_source": {
