    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan3_LunTaiSuiXiaoXian_L015",
      "original_quote": "紫微太陽武曲天梁七殺，甲庚丁己生人財官雙美。",
      "tag": [],
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "_source": {
