    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan3_LunTaiSuiXiaoXian_L017",
      "original_quote": "廉貞貪狼破軍在寅，丙戊生人招官非，甲子生人不喜寅申歲限。",
      "tag": [],
      "paragraph_index": 0,
